def practice():
    body=f'''<section class="page-intro"><div class="wrap narrow">{eyebrow('PRACTISE INTENTIONALLY')}<h1>Less guessing.<br><span class="gradient-text">More understanding.</span></h1><p>Start with an intuitive explanation, then test yourself with original, checked practice questions.</p></div></section><section class="section compact-section" id="lesson"><div class="wrap"><div class="lesson-shell"><div class="lesson-side"><span class="small-label">MICRO LESSON / 01</span><h2>Units digit.<br>Big powers.<br>Small patterns.</h2><p>Why do powers of 7 end in the same four digits, again and again?</p><div class="lesson-chip">NUMBER SYSTEMS</div></div><div class="lesson-body"><h3>Look at the repeating pattern.</h3><p>Only the last digit matters. Repeatedly multiplying by 7 gives these units digits:</p><div class="cycle-grid"><div><small>7¹</small><strong>7</strong></div><div><small>7²</small><strong>9</strong></div><div><small>7³</small><strong>3</strong></div><div><small>7⁴</small><strong>1</strong></div></div><p>The pattern then repeats: 7, 9, 3, 1. To find the units digit of 7<sup>2026</sup>, divide the exponent by 4. Remainder 2 means the second digit in the cycle: <strong>9</strong>.</p><div class="lesson-callout"><span>REMEMBER</span><b>When a power cycle has length 4, remainder 0 means choose the 4th digit—not the first.</b></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section-soft" id="quiz"><div class="wrap quiz-layout"><div class="quiz-intro">{eyebrow('FREE INTERACTIVE QUIZ')}<h2>Now it's your turn.</h2><p>Eight original questions. No sign-up needed. Explanations appear after you check your answers.</p><div class="quiz-sticky-note">Original practice • Not official PYQs</div></div><div class="quiz-panel"><div data-quiz-root></div><div class="quiz-actions"><button class="button button-primary" data-quiz-submit type="button">Check my answers ↗</button><button class="button button-light" data-quiz-reset type="button">Start again</button></div><div class="quiz-result" data-quiz-result aria-live="polite" hidden></div></div></div></section>'''
    return shell('practice.html','Practise Aptitude','Learn units digit patterns and take a free eight-question interactive mathematics quiz.',body)

